        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1365252204,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "Vaccinium myrtilloides is cultivated and grown commercially in Canada and Maine, primarily harvested from managed wild patches. The edible fruit is one of the sweetest blueberries known.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "es": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (es): Vaccinium myrtilloides § Cultivo",
        "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaccinium_myrtilloides#Cultivo",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 174047419,
        "heading": "Cultivo",
        "text": "V. myrtilloides crece y se cultiva comercialmente en Canadá y Maine, principalmente en parcelas silvestres gestionadas. Su fruto comestible​ es uno de los arándanos más dulces conocidos.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
